# Scratch probes are copied into the tree, run, and removed (see the
# workbench tools). If a session is interrupted mid-probe the file can
# survive; it must never be committable, because a stray *.test.ts runs in
# the suite and inflates the counts.
**/src/tmp*.test.ts
